  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="article-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-r-c01" subtype="intro-title">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漢口近事</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f01-r-c02" subtype="intro">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漢口於十年前有英醫設局施醫、以拯病者、藥不取資功期速</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f01-r-c03" subtype="intro">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">效、所活人不可以數計、今擬開拓館地勸衆捐輸、現為英醫名</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f01-r-c04" subtype="intro">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">立德者董其事、而華醫楊鑑堂參助、誠善舉也茲將其公啟登錄、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f01-r-c05" subtype="article-title">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漢口花樓仁濟醫院敬啟</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f01-r-c06" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">原夫身體強健、自然心定神安、倘有寒暑失宜、抑為困苦所廹、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f01-r-c07" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">則病生焉、而醫倘矣、順境者發心樂助、逆境者願意蒙恩、則舉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f01-r-c08" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">施醫送藥、不取分文、尤為濟世利人所推急務也、本醫院創建</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f01-r-c09" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">七載於茲、人分遠近、病別重輕、或使住院就醫、或使攜藥回屋、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f01-r-c10" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">若老若少、有女有男、惟望俱痊、何堪忽視、施刀圭以起沉疴、投</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title">
              <label>版心</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown" xml:lang="lzh">中西聞見錄　各國近事　完　八月</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left" xml:lang="lzh">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-l-c01" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">藥餌而除痼疾、已久在衆心、不詳開數目矣、特有三慮敬陳一</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f01-l-c02" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">聽、首則地勢低窪、水淹時未能開診、次則鄰居穢濁、氣蒸處最</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f01-l-c03" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">碍病人、三則為屋太小一總住人不多、且授業情殷、每思廣傳</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f01-l-c04" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">醫學、奈樓運地狹、至今未集生徒、日者選有佳地、議欲遷居、屋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f01-l-c05" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">造多間、功催速作、俾三慮立見消除、誠萬全出茲計畫、凡造院</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f01-l-c06" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">經費、及逐年開銷、想洋商自然仍舊樂捐、望華人亦可從新慨</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f01-l-c07" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">助、隔重洋者久徵踴躍、共一國者愈切輸將、捨本國之財濟本</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f01-l-c08" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">國之苦、發乎至情、本乎天理、敬請貴官、酌分鶴俸、篤痌瘝在抱</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f01-l-c09" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之仁、紳商量賜鴻施、著胞與為懷之美、雖用等不貲、若三千銀</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f01-l-c10" subtype="article">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">始得、而事成最善、為矜恤人所歡、茲蒙台助、早列尊名、</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">澳洲國家圖書館 `nla.gen-vn514067-14-s32-v`。左右各10欄，末欄『早列尊名』後留空。冊後一幅另起輪船廣告。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
